  $t$Written by W4 on the operator's press of the replacement card at 01:31 CST 2026-11-24 in W4's thread, with no run live (Wall 11448; audit 41285, whose note names the card "Write ASK 590"). Engine moMxiV4Irg1uRBZN a17c7a7b to d819ff4c-059d-438a-96f0-36ca31e93021, 422 nodes; changed: Close Enforcer Build, Close Enforcer Record, Panel Build, Build Independent Verdict, Close Group Batch Build, Send Back Build, Alt Send Back Build, Shared Library; the anti-cheat path leaves the flow and its six nodes stay, reached by nothing. Child MqQHRl7mQQ0z8QdT e9ddab5e to 31329164-efe2-40c9-8791-be855e8025b4; changed: R2 Alt Send Back Build, Shared Library. LIB 8ebbd11e9443b540, MAP 3ae647f38b5b74ac. What is live (card590.md): the closing enforcer's two reads answer each verse a side reads in both its close and its earlier rounds with CONFIRMED, REVERSED READING or NOT A CONTRADICTION. A REVERSED READING stands only when both reads give it, both quotations stand word for word in that side's own rounds, neither is the other side's sentence, and both stand under the same verse; a CONFIRMED contradiction on the same pair wins. Every answer is an E-CLOSECON row of debate_enforcer_log; a reversed reading is not a debater fault. The judges are shown the block [REVERSED CLOSE SENTENCES] in place of the [ANTI-CHEAT CHECK] notes. A judge line that quotes 8 or more words in a row of a reversed close sentence goes back once as E-REVCLOSE; the judge keeps the decision (ruling 428); the item is not counted against any seat. Ruling 427's rule is kept and its TRIAL status ends. No new model call. The path: plan draft graded PASS with F1 and F2 (Wall 11389); the operator's press "Build it, with the send-back" (row 516); build rev 0 (Wall 11424), W1 PASS (Wall 11425); re-cut on the ASK 593 write (Wall 11444), W1 PASS (Wall 11446); the write (Wall 11448); W1 readback MATCH (Wall 11449). IN PART, for two reasons. (1) No run has executed on d819ff4c or any later version: the proofs are offline rep